WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.862 --> 00:00:14.563
afternoon, Dr.

2
00:00:14.703 --> 00:00:17.104
Dolittle returned home with Tommy.

3
00:00:17.845 --> 00:00:21.046
The doctor told Tommy's parents about Tommy's idea.

4
00:00:21.567 --> 00:00:23.968
Tommy listened anxiously as they talked.

5
00:00:24.808 --> 00:00:28.250
"I will teach Tommy everything I know," Dr.

6
00:00:28.290 --> 00:00:29.351
Dolittle promised.

7
00:00:29.771 --> 00:00:33.705
"He will learn to read and write, and a great deal more."

8
00:00:35.527 --> 00:00:37.948
Tommy saw his parents smile at each other.

9
00:00:38.669 --> 00:00:40.450
His heart leapt with excitement.

10
00:00:40.470 --> 00:00:45.933
"Tommy will make a fine assistant, I am certain," said the doctor.

11
00:00:46.774 --> 00:00:48.555
So his parents let Tommy go.

12
00:00:49.216 --> 00:00:54.619
As he left his home, strolling beside the great doctor, Tommy was bursting with pride.

13
00:00:57.021 --> 00:00:59.362
It wasn't easy being an assistant, though.

14
00:00:59.382 --> 00:01:03.081
"This is the chicken feed," Polynesia explained.

15
00:01:03.101 --> 00:01:06.584
"But be careful that the raccoons don't steal the food."

16
00:01:06.604 --> 00:01:10.887
"Rufus! You stay away!"

17
00:01:11.347 --> 00:01:12.508
squawked one chicken.

18
00:01:12.528 --> 00:01:16.812
"I'm just passing by," the raccoon said innocently.

19
00:01:19.113 --> 00:01:21.535
Every day Tommy learned something new.

20
00:01:21.555 --> 00:01:24.498
"Did you irritate Coco again, Franny?"

21
00:01:24.898 --> 00:01:27.360
the doctor sternly asked a crying lamb.

22
00:01:28.292 --> 00:01:29.853
"Of course not, Dr.

23
00:01:29.873 --> 00:01:34.516
Dolittle! He just has a bad temper," Franny complained.

24
00:01:34.536 --> 00:01:36.497
"What's going on?"

25
00:01:36.817 --> 00:01:37.717
whispered Tommy.

26
00:01:37.737 --> 00:01:42.180
"Franny and Coco don't get along," Polynesia answered.

27
00:01:42.200 --> 00:01:43.941
"Who's Coco?"

28
00:01:44.441 --> 00:01:45.102
asked Tommy.

29
00:01:45.122 --> 00:01:48.303
"A chimpanzee with a short tail.

30
00:01:48.764 --> 00:01:52.906
He can't hang from trees like other monkeys," Polynesia explained.

31
00:01:52.926 --> 00:01:56.148
"So Franny teases him and Coco bites her."

32
00:01:56.712 --> 00:01:59.633
The doctor put some medicine on Franny's sore bite.

33
00:01:59.653 --> 00:02:02.495
"Ouch!" baaa-ed the lamb.

34
00:02:03.955 --> 00:02:07.337
Being an assistant meant helping the doctor with many things.

35
00:02:08.057 --> 00:02:11.279
This included learning the language of the wiff-waff.

36
00:02:12.159 --> 00:02:17.642
The doctor pulled his head out of the fish tank and cooed: "Boodi-bob-hop-sop."

37
00:02:18.042 --> 00:02:19.622
Tommy stared at him blankly.

38
00:02:23.356 --> 00:02:24.857
"Boodi-bob oh, sorry, Tommy."

39
00:02:24.897 --> 00:02:25.957
Dr. Dolittle chuckled.

40
00:02:25.977 --> 00:02:29.519
"I was speaking to you in pigeon language."

41
00:02:29.999 --> 00:02:30.920
Tommy smiled.

42
00:02:30.940 --> 00:02:33.040
"Can you get me some more water?"

43
00:02:33.881 --> 00:02:36.562
Dr. Dolittle asked, this time in English.

44
00:02:37.823 --> 00:02:42.165
Every chance she got, Polynesia helped Tommy learn the animals' language.

45
00:02:43.025 --> 00:02:45.926
Tommy and Polynesia spent hours in the garden.

46
00:02:46.727 --> 00:02:49.548
Tommy was anxious to learn, but it wasn't easy.

47
00:02:50.420 --> 00:02:53.022
Tommy listened and watched a horse carefully.

48
00:02:53.042 --> 00:02:56.204
"Now what is the horse saying?"

49
00:02:56.805 --> 00:02:57.985
Polynesia whispered.

50
00:02:58.005 --> 00:03:01.048
"I am getting so fat!"

51
00:03:02.829 --> 00:03:03.850
the horse neighed.

52
00:03:03.870 --> 00:03:07.412
"You're not!

53
00:03:07.792 --> 00:03:10.995
Don't be silly," mooed a nearby cow.

54
00:03:11.915 --> 00:03:14.757
Tommy turned to Polynesia and tried to interpret.

55
00:03:14.777 --> 00:03:20.813
"The horse is angry at the cow," he said, "because she eats too much."

56
00:03:21.633 --> 00:03:24.074
Polynesia covered her mouth and giggled.

57
00:03:24.094 --> 00:03:31.777
"I don't understand human language," neighed the horse to the cow, "but did he just call you fat?"

58
00:03:32.397 --> 00:03:35.499
Tommy was puzzled why the cow snorted loudly at him.

59
00:03:37.479 --> 00:03:38.920
After a while, Dr.

60
00:03:38.960 --> 00:03:42.401
Dolittle began teaching Tommy how to examine the animals.

61
00:03:42.421 --> 00:03:45.923
"Lucas is very old," said Dr.

62
00:03:45.943 --> 00:03:48.344
Dolittle, as he patted an aging donkey.

63
00:03:48.936 --> 00:03:51.037
"So you need to be very gentle.

64
00:03:51.718 --> 00:03:55.940
Older animals have problems with their sight, digestion, and joints.

65
00:03:56.461 --> 00:03:57.941
They are also forgetful."

66
00:03:59.502 --> 00:04:02.684
Dr. Dolittle asked Tommy to stand in front of Lucas.

67
00:04:02.704 --> 00:04:06.306
"Now hold up two fingers," he instructed.

68
00:04:06.947 --> 00:04:08.408
Tommy did as he was told.

69
00:04:09.348 --> 00:04:12.010
Dr. Dolittle made some hee-hawing noises.

70
00:04:12.030 --> 00:04:14.651
"How many fingers do you see, Lucas?"

71
00:04:15.112 --> 00:04:15.632
he asked.

72
00:04:16.400 --> 00:04:19.401
Lucas blinked once and yawned loudly.

73
00:04:19.421 --> 00:04:25.404
"Pigs," continued the doctor, "are very smart animals.

74
00:04:25.804 --> 00:04:27.765
They know when it is time for their shots.

75
00:04:28.405 --> 00:04:29.866
So you have to distract them."

76
00:04:30.746 --> 00:04:32.567
The doctor snuck up on a pig.

77
00:04:33.207 --> 00:04:34.888
Tommy just stood there watching.

78
00:04:34.908 --> 00:04:37.869
"Come on, Tommy, do something!"

79
00:04:38.289 --> 00:04:39.429
encouraged the doctor.

80
00:04:40.750 --> 00:04:43.711
Tommy started to clap his hands and stamp his feet.

81
00:04:43.731 --> 00:04:45.332
"Keep going, Tommy!"

82
00:04:45.768 --> 00:04:46.428
urged Dr.

83
00:04:46.468 --> 00:04:49.510
Dolittle. Tommy waved his arms and danced.

84
00:04:51.131 --> 00:04:53.172
"What on earth is that boy doing?"

85
00:04:53.572 --> 00:04:54.413
oinked one pig.

86
00:04:54.433 --> 00:04:56.654
"Squeal! Snort!"

87
00:04:57.354 --> 00:04:58.775
said another in surprise.

88
00:04:59.535 --> 00:05:02.937
All the pigs got their shots while they watched Tommy dance.

89
00:05:03.738 --> 00:05:06.959
No, it was not easy being a doctor's assistant.
